│    structured_output, temporarily override self._tool_choice with  │
│    {"tool": {"name": tool_spec["name"]}} during the call to        │
│    self.stream, then restore it afterward.                         │
│                                                                    │
│ This minimal patch implements the requested configurable           │
│ toolChoice behavior without modifying other logic, preserving      │
│ existing streaming and output parsing.                             │
