73             guardrail_version: Version of the guardrail to apply
74             guardrail_stream_processing_mode: The guardrail processing mode
75             guardrail_redact_input: Flag to redact input if a guardrail is triggered. Defaults to True.
76             guardrail_redact_input_message: If a Bedrock Input guardrail triggers, replace the input with this message.
77             guardrail_redact_output: Flag to redact output if guardrail is triggered. Defaults to False.
78             guardrail_redact_output_message: If a Bedrock Output guardrail triggers, replace output with this message.
79             max_tokens: Maximum number of tokens to generate in the response
80             model_id: The Bedrock model ID (e.g., "us.anthropic.claude-sonnet-4-20250514-v1:0")
81             include_tool_result_status: Flag to include status field in tool results.
82                 True includes status, False removes status, "auto" determines based on model_id. Defaults to "auto".
83             stop_sequences: List of sequences that will stop generation when encountered
84             streaming: Flag to enable/disable streaming. Defaults to True.
85             temperature: Controls randomness in generation (higher = more random)
86             top_p: Controls diversity via nucleus sampling (alternative to temperature)
